# Title: File Download Via Nscurl - MacOS
# ID: 6d8a7cf1-8085-423b-b87d-7e880faabbdf
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Daniel Cortez
# Date: 2024-06-04
# Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects the execution of the nscurl utility in order to download files.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(process_name:*/nscurl AND (cmdline:*--download * OR cmdline:*--download-directory * OR cmdline:*--output * OR cmdline:*-dir * OR cmdline:*-dl * OR cmdline:*-ld* OR cmdline:*-o *))
